Bridge BakaSU 516d3e87 to SuSFS 0d5b1ceb (gki-android14-6.1).
Port the policy tracking and priority UID filter wiring from SuSFS's
KernelSU patch. Track AVTAB_ALLOWED only: audit rules share the same
source/target/class tuple but do not contain an access decision.
Rename BakaSU's blacklist pointer so built-in symbol lookup finds the
kernel loader's module_blacklist rather than the pointer itself.

